  "description": "Riders around the world have been shredding bikes built on this frame in all sorts of setups and indeed, although originally designated to be a pure-blooded freeride hardtail, the Surge is a great all round frame for anyone who likes to go hard. Perfect for new school freeride, yet at the same time comfortable on longer rides and great for dirt jumping. It will work correctly with 120 – 160 mm forks and 650B or 26” wheels. The Surge Evo will fit your favorite dropper post easily and will accept forks with both standard 1 1/8” or tapered 1.5 - 1 1/8” steerer tubes\nMAIN FEATURES:\n- designed for All Mountain, Freeride\n- high-end cromoly steel tubes\n- aggressive geometry (slack HA, low BB).\n- adjustable CS lenght via sliding dropouts",
